' v1.2 Extended's two-way radio (`preset extended ai amiga seed 12 give
' item_two_way_radio`). In info mode a click on Outback, which an opponent
' holds, gives the radio's report; "Okay" closes it. A click on the place he
' stands at gives no report but INFO; a click on a city its own report
' (`ShowCityReport`), not the radio's.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
day
wait 30
menu 250,160             ' the map's menu, near him
menuline 0               ' INFO
wait 10
mapclick 307,65          ' Outback: the report
wait 30
talkline 2               ' Okay
wait 10
mapclick 224,118         ' Hard Mans Death, where he stands: INFO
wait 30
press escape             ' INFO closed
wait 10
mapclick 31,157          ' Acid Town, a city: the city's report
wait 30
quit
